argo ship in the Gulf of Oman that ignored blockade warnings. Trump says talks via Qatar are making progress.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/08/us-forces-strike-commercial-vessel-in-gulf-of-oman-after-crew-ignored-repeated-warnings","published":"2026-11-08"},{"id":"n2","cat":"World","title":"Gunman kills six in Krak\u00f3w's historic Main Square","summary":"A 25-year-old Polish man with far-right views killed six people and injured 16, including two police officers, in Krak\u00f3w on Saturday. Officials called it an act of terror; Poland declared two days of mourning.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/07/at-least-five-killed-in-shooting-in-krakow-polish-police-say","published":"2026-11-07"},{"id":"n3","cat":"Business","title":"Strong October jobs report: 165,000 added, unemployment falls to 4.1%","summary":"U.S. employers added 165,000 jobs in October, well above forecasts near 70,000, and the jobless rate dipped to 4.1% from 4.2%. September was revised to 60,000.","source":"Yahoo Finance","url":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/live/stock-market-today-friday-november-6-dow-sp-500-nasdaq-jobs-report-earnings-135953863.html","published":"2026-11-06"},{"id":"n4","cat":"Canada","title":"Ottawa's budget gives CSIS record $6B boost","summary":"Budget 2026 gives CSIS about $6 billion over ten years, its largest increase ever. Analysts think it could fund a new foreign human-intelligence capability.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12140578/csis-budget-boost-foreign-intelligence/","published":"2026-11-06"},{"id":"n5","cat":"AI","title":"OpenAI reportedly raises $11B at a $1.25 trillion valuation","summary":"OpenAI has reportedly raised $11 billion in a round that may reach about $20 billion, at a $1.25 trillion valuation, below its earlier $1.4 trillion target.","source":"TechCrunch","url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/06/openai-reportedly-raises-an-additional-11-billion-at-a-1-25-trillion-valuation/","published":"2026-11-06"},{"id":"n6","cat":"World","title":"Herzog taps Eisenkot to form Israel's next government","summary":"Factions holding 67 of 120 Knesset seats backed centrist Gadi Eisenkot over Benjamin Netanyahu (46). He has 28 days, extendable by 14, to build a coalition.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/08/netanyahu-rival-eisenkot-to-be-tasked-with-forming-new-government-following-israeli-electi","published":"2026-11-08"},{"id":"n7","cat":"Business","title":"Nasdaq rebounds 1.1% Friday, but stocks close a down week","summary":"On Nov. 6 the S&P 500 rose 0.31% to 7,376.86 and the Nasdaq gained 1.09% to 24,579.42, while the Dow fell 0.46% to 51,285.73. For the week the S&P fell 2.7% and the Nasdaq 3.4%.","source":"Yahoo Finance","url":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/live/stock-market-today-friday-november-6-dow-sp-500-nasdaq-jobs-report-earnings-135953863.html","published":"2026-11-06"},{"id":"n8","cat":"World","title":"Russia fires 36 ballistic missiles at Kyiv region, hits power grid","summary":"Russia launched 36 ballistic missiles, including North Korean KN-23s, at Kyiv and nearby areas overnight; four were downed. At least six were hurt and substations in several regions were damaged.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/07/russia-fires-north-korean-missiles-at-key-ukrainian-energy-facility-zelenskyy-says","published":"2026-11-07"},{"id":"n9","cat":"Canada","title":"Unifor believes Stellantis has sold its Brampton plant","summary":"Unifor says Stellantis would not confirm or deny a finalized sale of the idle Brampton assembly plant, which it had discussed selling to Roshel. More than 2,000 workers were laid off there in 2023.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12141236/unifor-stellantis-brampton-plant/","published":"2026-11-07"},{"id":"n10","cat":"AI","title":"AI spending growth stalls as prices fall, Ramp data shows","summary":"Ramp data shows business AI token spend grew only 1.5% in August-September after a 42% jump in July, before an 8.9% rebound into October. Price cuts are weighing on revenue as Anthropic nears an IPO.","source":"TechCrunch","url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/06/ramp-data-shows-ai-spending-stalling-just-as-anthropic-nears-its-ipo/","published":"2026-11-06"},{"id":"n11","cat":"Major","title":"Midterm results cloud outlook for data centers and Elon Musk","summary":"After Democrats' big midterm win, voters backed dozens of local data-centre restrictions, and Texas governor-elect Gina Hinojosa ran on limiting them. Musk reportedly gave about $500 million to Republicans.","source":"TechCrunch","url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/07/after-the-midterms-things-are-looking-rocky-for-elon-musk-and-data-centers/","published":"2026-11-07"},{"id":"n12","cat":"Canada","title":"Joly asks Competition Bureau to probe Stelco's U.S. owner","summary":"Industry Minister Melanie Joly asked the Competition Bureau to examine Cleveland-Cliffs' conduct after Stelco began issuing layoff notices to about 500 Hamilton workers.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12140292/joly-stelco-investigation/","published":"2026-11-06"},{"id":"n13","cat":"World","title":"New Zealand election too close to call","summary":"With about 42% counted, Labour had 29.7% and the governing National Party 29.4%, with the Greens at 14%. No party is expected to win a majority.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/07/new-zealand-counts-votes-in-razor-thin-election-after-campaign-centred-on-cost-of-living","published":"2026-11-07"},{"id":"n14","cat":"Business","title":"Berkshire Hathaway doubles buybacks to $9.6B in Q3","summary":"Berkshire bought back about $9.6 billion of stock in Q3, up from $4.5 billion in Q2. Operating earnings fell 5.8% to $12.7 billion and cash reached about $377 billion.","source":"CNBC","url":"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/07/berkshire-hathaway-q3-2026-earnings-buybacks.html","published":"2026-11-07"},{"id":"n15","cat":"AI","title":"U.S. memo says Chinese spies targeted Nvidia CEO via tech exec","summary":"A U.S. intelligence memo alleges China's Ministry of State Security recruited a Megaspeed executive to spy on Jensen Huang. Nvidia says his interactions were not unusual.","source":"TechCrunch","url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/07/chinese-exec-was-recruited-to-spy-on-nvidia-ceo-according-to-us-intelligence-memo/","published":"2026-11-07"},{"id":"n16","cat":"Canada","title":"Budget 2026 omits foreign aid for first time in 15+ years","summary":"The federal budget is the first since at least 2010 not to mention foreign aid, aid groups say. Ottawa is expected to keep a planned $2.7 billion aid cut over four years.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12141139/budget-2026-foreign-aid/","published":"2026-11-07"},{"id":"n17","cat":"AI","title":"Google takes over Crusoe's Wyoming data center project","summary":"Crusoe sold its unfinished southeastern Wyoming data centre project to Google, which plans to invest $17 billion in the campus. The price was not disclosed.","source":"TechCrunch","url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/06/crusoe-sells-troubled-wyoming-data-center-project-to-google/","published":"2026-11-06"},{"id":"n18","cat":"Major","title":"Man with three guns arrested near White House","summary":"The Secret Service arrested a man in a stolen car on Constitution Avenue with three firearms and dozens of rounds. DHS says he threatened to kill President Trump.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/07/us-secret-service-arrests-man-parked-near-white-house-with-multiple-guns-in-vehicle","published":"2026-11-07"},{"id":"n19","cat":"Major","title":"Pope Leo XIV draws 40,000 to Mass in Uruguay","summary":"Weeks after lung surgery, Pope Leo XIV celebrated Mass for over 40,000 people in Paysand\u00fa, Uruguay, saying peace is possible and must be built.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/07/peace-is-possible-and-we-are-called-to-build-it-pope-leo-xiv-says-in-uruguay","published":"2026-11-07"}]}